{"name":"Shasuna","question":"how to win","reading":"You have been avoiding a truth you already know. Every distraction you reach for is proof of its weight. The longer you wait, the louder it will become.","_id":"1x1P5ockx4ZLlmyE"}
{"name":"anna","question":"help me","reading":"Your heart is blocked by a past you refuse to release. You have built walls where there should be windows. What once protected you is now keeping you prisoner.","_id":"cXcCYZ9LBd8IoOni"}
{"name":"Shasuna","question":"I need help","reading":"You are carrying a burden that is not yours to bear. It has worn down your spirit and clouded your judgment. Release it before it becomes a permanent part of you.","_id":"nMPOnqViGU2AioYM"}
{"name":"joe","question":"help me","reading":"You seek validation from those who cannot give it. You have been looking in the wrong places for a very long time. What you need has always been inside you.","_id":"qV0aMPMOHLSpq79A"}
{"name":"Hahaah","question":"hbsjbs","reading":"You have been avoiding a truth you already know. Every distraction you reach for is proof of its weight. The longer you wait, the louder it will become.","_id":"eX5tUKNQluWMSsLY"}
